      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# CAUCE 72 · sequential H3 latent pass\n\nPass 1 is a normal full-denoise FL2VA generation. Its phase-safe H3 AV latent\nis then spatially warped without decode/re-encode. Pass 2 uses the same endpoint\nconditioning, a fresh seed, and denoise 0.35. This is an experiment topology,\nnot a production default: compare it against a single composed-map sample."
      ],
      "color": "#24382a",
      "bgcolor": "#132019"
    },
